WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
This place is too close to the eastern border of Omae

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:05,160
It's mid-autumn now and the weather is getting colder

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:08,480
So recently there has been constant friction between Daqian and many tribes on the border with the Northern Barbarians.

4
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:11,880
Almost every day there will be some small armies of the Northern Barbarian Dynasty

5
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,320
Smuggling into Omae territory

6
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,840
Create chaos and loot supplies to stay one night longer

7
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,420
On the one hand, it is to prevent looking at

8
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:22,840
There is another aspect: Are there any Northern Barbarians participating in the soldiers?

9
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,920
I want to temporarily give these innocent women

10
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:28,370
a sense of security

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,680
Facing the bloody remains of corpses

12
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,600
They can clean it up without hesitation

13
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,560
Facing the family tragedy that just happened

14
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:36,720
and the pain of losing a loved one

15
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:39,000
They can shake their teeth and continue to live.

16
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,320
No hope of giving up life

17
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:43,000
Anyway, these women look weak on the surface.

18
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,040
But my heart is so strong that it’s a bit scary

19
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:49,340
Master, it's time to eat. Where did this food come from?

20
00:00:50,810 --> 00:00:55,320
Sister Liu made this specially for you to thank you for being your benefactor. I won’t do this next time.

21
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:56,960
If there is a next time

22
